        "sid": "MAT 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iita Sabaato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damandida gwasik Yesu jeeda madameega eaweeda sabaato. Iidu ghwayeat jih giinealangaaschi, ak gwahirjeaweada muschoonga ak ghwaak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daah Farisaayajeega gissin giinealanga gwarukusa Yesu gideaba, “Ang'wearda, giinealangaagu gwasin ng'asheanda mamiisiina sinooda eaweeda sabaato.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha saawa, “Heapi miyoasoamwana gidaghayi sin Dawdi sea fuga mideawa damanda yeada jih: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gidabeada jeeda gheeda ASEETA ak ghwaak mukaateeyda giihiimnooda, nea mamiisiina gideaba gayghwaak niny ghana fuga mideawa geaghus ghwaak ashoohoodiga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghana miyoasoamwana aba jeeda deaweeda gideaba gili was askwearjeanda sabaato iissa ghwadatas ashoohoodiga diineeda Yahudi deaweeda aba jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA ak ea moawa giidiinyeanda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi geayeeshiineegwa hiji gwanda siida haweewa eara gheeda sibata ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama inyeeda gajanala iiteaba ng'asheesu, ‘Geagasayi baydeayda mii haleanjeeda sisapa geadi bea ghadooweeda,’ gwachi majooparana fuga manda gidamuy nisin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba Orjeeda Siida niny Ng'utamiida sabaatohi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siida aptu geatinda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghabeawa hoowa ak gawa jeeda ghooriida nyaawa siinealshacheewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda gwanda hoowa siida aptu geatinda. Geanyaash nea geeyeesha, “Ghwahidi gideaba gajeahaap siida eaweeda Sabaato?” Geanyaash ng'asheanji nea geegasa gichea eahaaktaayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha saawa, “Aba jeedeang'wa gajea ng'eaha jea gang'adeesa gisilleandaanyi jeeda shoomanda eaweeda Sabaato jea ea maygwalealu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida ghang'al gisilleanda niba hada! Ada abeeda ghwahit siinooda ng'asheega miyaasiin eaweeda Sabaato.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha siidida, “Adoabiiwa geatindaang'u.” Ghoadoabiiw, ak ghahaap ea gawuurji geatinda niirja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gwarita Farisaayajeega jarooda ak ghwadawdaaw gichea gwanuusta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Soomjeanda loat ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeyi bwak ama jeeng'u Yesu ng'asheanji ghabeawa hoowa. Ghwaat geeshta fuga saang'a ak ghoahaap fuga miyeani sean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghaheawa nea gwayeesha adoorukusi sih iiteanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gwasa gida ghayi rugu sibaneeda siguura Isaya nea gwayi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ea Beelsebuli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Geeyeassa siisi ng'oaw biissa ea manda ghuuta bearji meangeenda; ghoahaap ak ghoang'wearda nea gabalool. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghahamng'eanyi buuneesean nea gwayi, “Siisi mii orjeeda Dawdihi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiy Farisaayajeega ng'asheesu gwayi, “Siisi ghahoan meangeenda aba gideaba gwandeawa uurda Beelsebuli, meang'nyeandida bea eenda hawiin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwajeeng'u gidabaloola saawa aba jeesinga nyaawa ak gwayeesha, “Sugoocheanduumeeda wassean iibearshi ea maygamajeegiit, ghana eara mujiini ghana gheeda wassean iidardaawaat, gheawi ea mayghamiinaada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shataani iihoan Shataani, abeeda gang'uchi geaw. Abeeda sugoocheanduumeadaanyi gayghamiinaadaydaan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini iyearuuteawi meangeenda uurda Beelsebuli, heapi! Abeeda orjoogeagwa saawa gooruutiideawa naaha? Aba gideaba saawa fuga jea goorgweakseegwa agooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ghamneawa earuuteawi meangeenda uurda Guroorooda ASEETA, abeeda ghoanali gideaba nihidu heedeang'wa Sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gayghoamuustaan siida gideaba gayghabwasay gheeda siida mideawa uurda ak ghoareat haleanjeadaanyi, nea miighanyi gwarada siidida mideawa uurdean? Ak abeeda gayghoamu ghoareat haleanjeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida manda meatkweedeanyu niifuurnean muwuuta, nea siida wassean mabwadana geat sea aniini ghoadaarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba sareani geayeeshiineegwa, buuneeda gajeesamsa riing'eega nyaawa sean ea giing'weaka nyaawa sean, duuku fuga ang'eawi Guroorooda Ghaydit rukuna badayda ng'asheega munyas mayghwanyas samsiinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu gicha siida jea gwarukuna ng'asheanda muy badayda Orjeeda Siida gajeesamsa, duuku siidida jea gwarugu ng'asheanda muy badayda Guroorooda Ghaydidiin, ea majeesamsa aba jeedeaba ng'eanyiini, ghana eara aba ng'eanyiita jea ghoahiiduunu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Geeta ea haghweagaaschi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asina geeta ghamiidu ak ghamiyaasiit eara haghweagaaschi, ghana anung' gamunyiit geeta ak gamunyasiidi eara haghweagaaschi aba gideaba geeta geenala haghweagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea dayeega udang'usheega! Gajoamuustaan rukunooda ng'asheega miyaasiin nea goowooschi munyas? Aba gideaba siida iissa gwarugu ng'asheega nyiit guroroadaanyiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida miy aba jeeda gheaseadaanyi miy iissa gwarugu ng'asheega miyaas, nea siida muy aba jeeda gheaseadaanyi muy iissa gwarugu ng'asheega munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi geayeeshiineegwa, eaweeda girgweaksiinda gaygaba siisi rugu ng'asheanda marachi gil ghayi nyooh ea nirugu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba aba ng'asheagaagu gajeegoonyi doobiiwnata, ak aba ng'asheagaagu gajeergweakseey.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gasooda ng'asheega deamdeameadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Ng'oorshoodiga ea Farisaayajeega, “Giinealshoocheanda geegasayi eadaaha gwadeagooda aba headaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha nea gwayeesha, “Seaygeeda munyas biissa gamealuuli ak ea mwajeataw gwadeagooda; geaghus gwadeagooda ghayi bea sibaneeda siguura Yona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji gida abiideata Yona jeeda ghweayeanda haw eawooji samwagu eawa ea askweari nih gichea gawuurji Orjeeda Siida gaygoobiida jeesigeeda eawooji samwagu eawa ea askweari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gayghamiinaada fuga Ninawi eaweeda girgweaksiinda ak gaygoorgweaksa seaygeani aba gideaba gwandeawa giidiinyeanda. Aba gideaba fuga Ninawi ghayi saawa gwaduukuuna riing'eeda aba ng'asheega rukwiida Yona, nea aba hiji gwanda siida haweewa Yona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gayghwahidu gatmooda ahaaghwa Wiilooda Ng'eanyiida Biyeara eaweeda jea eergweaksiina seaygeani, ak gaygoorgweaksa aba gideaba gwandeawa fiisu giidiinyeanda. Aba gideaba niny gwasimna deasheagi ak ghwaan gooleeysiit weaghuumeeda Sulemani, nea ging'ulayi gwanda hiji siida haweewa Sulemani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Biiknooda meang'nyeandeenda muy",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Meang'nyeandeenda muy iiriteawa siida iissa gwaneayeewa ng'eanyiida manda beega, nea gagasa heechea gafuufa ak ea mwanyasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu gwayeesha geaw, ‘Gaydabiikta gheenyu heeta earini.’ Biigu ghwahita nea siipuus ak ea sisisin nea manda jeeda sih. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat gawa ak gweadu meangeenda suuk ispwa, munyas ea ghwalaabwa hoowa niny, ak ghapka sean ghamway jeedeaba siisi; amadu gamunyiit seareedeaba siidida ea ghwalaabwa hoowa dea ghayi bea mwadi. Nih gichea gawuurji gil aba seaygeeni ghamneawa munyasiin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gheamata Yesu ea orjooga geenyea Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda duu gabaloola sea buuneeda, hean ghwahidu ghaamwat sea orjooga ghaamwat ak ghamiinaada aba gidaghuuta nea gagasa goobalool. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Siyagi ak gwayeesha, “Ng'ula gwanda geamadu ea orjooga geamadu jarooda ghamiinaada nea gagasa goobaloolnyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha nea gwayeesha siidida adaw iitean, “Iya ng'eaha, ama orjooga giyeanya geabeang'a?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghamiin giinealangaaschi nea gwayeesha, “Ng'ula iyya ea orjooga giyeanya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 12:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba siida wassean nyooh gwasin gidida bwariiy Bwaabeeda mida humng'eedean, siisi abeeda orjeeda giyeanya gil, ea huda giyeanya, ea iyya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.12.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
